<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed sharply lower in active trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 94.04 to 6517.01.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 4.43 to 395.37.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.46.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1710 to 816.</p>
<p>Volume was 478,126,600, compared with 507,038,730 on Tuesday.</p>
